    "summary": "The user expresses profound hopelessness and existential dread stemming from insurmountable financial debt, eventually hinting at the desire to \"stop fighting it.\" The assistant consistently responds with empathy, validates the difficulty of the situation without endorsing the hopelessness, and ultimately provides a direct intervention with crisis resources when the user's intent becomes clearer.",
